{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 34","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/b/95b32de74615979c249deba9dce5f2ed3dc87b7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=1+2i+3i^2+\\cdots+(n+1)i^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"261\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75952e52a3dc061d24146c0df9062a54a5ce5a5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=\\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" />, equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b71628b0b812b3735d3f3c51cf6fa31502328c01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1+i\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{1}{2}(n+2)\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{1}{2}(n+2-ni)\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"386\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b188c3a33d644a07c1424325ccc138a7f1c44cd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{1}{2}[(n+1)(1-i)+2]\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\frac{1}{8}(n^2+8-4ni)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"389\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The real part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/61543e0dc72e3f121b75a74bcba7172bffbe2df6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 3i^2 + 5i^4 + ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/8/6a8c02eb4aa9f617b2c1aebd70a5d3c9c471d63f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - 3 + 5 - 7 + ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then we have an odd number of terms in total:  we start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/02349576cee613512cdf301a365f06c0760acab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then add two more terms to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc67ddf43ce0436ddda2fce1c6992979f0243cfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - 3 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cf3e35a4981583288d2a7c4b34989916fb7360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, etc.  With each successive addition, we're really adding a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/7/fe71f241e5785061722270eacd1922c7fdddf426.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3 + 5 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/a/53a0ae09ddd00607b4398764be0e2989387a73b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-7 + 9 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />, etc.  \n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6fc266463b33c8b1c079a50909f3fd03ed5ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cf3e35a4981583288d2a7c4b34989916fb7360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Since the sum increases linearly, the real part of the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad7c30abb9b25cd099d1454f0b955ce33f3af28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\frac{1}{2}n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>The imaginary part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33f0e47f0f7deeefb80e5819915e83ae50c91e59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{i}(2i + 4i^3 + 6i^5 + ...)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"168\" height=\"37\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/d/2cd6813d587df9c0374e900b881c3f61d96d517c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 - 4 + 6 - 8 + ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" />.  This time, we have an even number of terms.  We group pairs of terms to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1fcc11752ede7e2508a6faa5073172eae56f0c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2-4) + (6-8) + ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"18\" />, and notice that each pair gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.  Again, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/02349576cee613512cdf301a365f06c0760acab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> the imaginary part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, while with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cf3e35a4981583288d2a7c4b34989916fb7360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> the imaginary part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.  Since again the sum increases linearly, this means the imaginary part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7ff3696e4806ade34988073453d2270fbf166f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{n}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"27\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>Combining the real and imaginary parts gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/0125d55a774288d4f666554e2177374c5c92d0ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{2} + 1 - \\frac{n}{2}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"89\" height=\"33\" />, which is equivalent to option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">Problem 33</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">Problem 35</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl